.snakemake/

# Private authoring / governance material -- never part of the Snakemake
# DAG, must never be baked into a built image. The published image is
# always built by CI from a fresh `actions/checkout`, so anything not
# tracked by git (see .gitignore / .git/info/exclude) is already absent
# from that build context; the generic patterns below are a second,
# belt-and-braces layer for anyone building locally from a working copy
# that still has such files on disk (Docker does not consult .gitignore
# on its own).
manuscript/**
docs/Journals/
docs/claude_code_prompt*.odt
*_REPORT.md
*_AUDIT.md
*_REVIEW.md
*_FOLLOWUP.md
*_ANALYSIS.md
*_VERIFICATION.md
*_STRATEGY.md
*_ROADMAP.md
project_charter.yaml
docs/execution_manual/DEVELOPMENT_NOTES.md
docs/execution_manual/DEVELOPMENT_NOTES.pdf
docs/reproducibility_investigation.md
docs/reproducibility_investigation_evidence/
docs/remaining_steps_for_publication.md
docs/remaining_steps_for_publication.pdf
.claude/
